    - [x] **Admin Sync Button:** `MemberSyncButton` component added to `/admin/settings` → "Gestion des Membres" tab.
    - [x] **Retention Policy:** 90 days for `LEFT`, 30 days for `KICKED`, immediate anonymization for `BANNED`.
    - [x] **Discord Webhook:** `/api/discord/webhook` with Ed25519 signature verification for `GUILD_MEMBER_REMOVE` and `GUILD_BAN_ADD`.
    - [x] **No-Guild Message:** `NoGuildMessage` component with logout button for members without active guilds.
    - [x] **Redirect Loop Fix:** Dashboard no longer redirects to `/` when user has no guilds (was causing infinite loop).
    - [x] **Rate Limit Fallback:** If Discord returns 429, falls back to DB profiles to avoid blocking access.
    - [x] **SignOutButton Component:** Reusable client component for logout in Server Components.
    - [x] **All Error Pages Updated:** "Retour à l'accueil" replaced with "Se déconnecter" to prevent loops.
    - [x] **VPS Deployment Guide:** `docs/DEPLOYMENT.md` with Nginx, PM2, Cron setup instructions.
    - [x] **Vitest Setup:** Test framework configured with path aliases and coverage (12 lifecycle tests).

