## 5. Security Implementation Summary (Reference)

**API Routes Protection Pattern:**
```typescript
// All API routes MUST use this pattern:
const session = await auth();
if (!session?.user?.id) return 401;

const user = await getUserContext(guildId);
if (!user.isMember) return 403;
if (!user.isAdmin && routeRequiresAdmin) return 403;
```

**Server Actions Protection Pattern:**
```typescript
// All server actions MUST use this pattern:
const ctx = await getUserContext(guildId);
if (!ctx.isAuthenticated) throw new Error("Unauthorized");
if (!ctx.isMember) throw new Error("Not a member");
```

**Automated Security:**
- Dependabot scans every Monday 9 AM (Paris)
- GitHub Actions run `npm audit` on every push
- 30-day audit log retention
